      <constructor name="catch_loop" c:identifier="dex_future_catch_loop">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="src/dex-future.c"
             line="621">Asynchronously calls @callback when @future rejects.

This is similar to [ctor@Dex.Future.catch] except that it will call
@callback multiple times as each returned [class@Dex.Future] rejects,
allowing for infinite loops.</doc>
