      <method name="spawnv"
              c:identifier="dex_scheduler_spawnv"
              introspectable="0">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="src/dex-scheduler.c"
             line="331">Same as dex_scheduler_spawn() but trampolines into a fiber without having to
create special structures on the way there.

```c
static DexFuture *
fiber_func (GInputStream *stream,
            int           num)
{
  ...

  return dex_future_new_true ();
}

DexFuture *
spawn_fiber (GInputStream *stream)
{
  return dex_scheduler_spawnv (NULL, 0,
                               G_CALLBACK (fiber_func),
                               2,
                               G_TYPE_POINTER, stream,
                               G_TYPE_INT, 42);
}
```</doc>
