    <function name="aio_close" c:identifier="dex_aio_close" version="1.2">
      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="src/dex-aio.c"
           line="44">An asynchronous `close()` wrapper.

This function takes ownership of @fd and will close it asynchronously.

Generally you want to provide `NULL` for the @aio_context as that
will get the default aio context for your scheduler.</doc>
