      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="src/dex-gio.c"
           line="620">Reads a line from the data input stream.

Wraps [method@Gio.DataInputStream.read_line_async].</doc>
      <source-position filename="src/dex-gio.h" line="219"/>
